# Large STAT cache — 2.4 GB, auto-fetched by 01_stat/02_fetch/stat_fetch.py (all of
# stat_fetch/data/ is fetch-stage cache/checkpoints; stat_filter/data/ holds
# the actual final outputs — runs.tsv etc. — and stays tracked)
01_stat/02_fetch/data/*
!01_stat/02_fetch/data/manifest.tsv

# Intermediate confirmed-run caches — regeneratable from stat_cache
01_stat/03_filter/data/*_confirmed.json

# Large species distribution table (38k rows)
01_stat/03_filter/data/*_species_dist.tsv

# Reference DB source files — auto-downloaded by 01_stat/01_build/stat_build.py
01_stat/01_build/data/phi-base_current.csv
01_stat/01_build/data/ictv_vmr.xlsx

# meta_search.py raw API response caches — regeneratable
02_literature/01_search/data/bp_cache.json
02_literature/01_search/data/bs_cache.json
02_literature/01_search/data/serper_cache.json

# meta_text.py: manually-downloaded copyrighted journal PDFs (715MB+, and not
# ours to redistribute) — never committed. Its .bak sibling is working-copy
# cruft, also excluded.
02_literature/02_text/data/manual_pdfs/
02_literature/02_text/data/text_cache.jsonl.bak

# The repo is for code (+ small figures/manifests to discuss results), not
# data — 2026-08-31 policy, purged from history at the same time. These are
